  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You have whispered into the wind and it, in turn, whispered back.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Charisma 15, ability to cast spells with the air descriptor.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Once per day, as a swift action that does not provoke an attack of opportunity, you can take on the Aspect of the First Wind. While active, you gain electricity resistance 5 and +2 bonus on saves against spells with the air and sonic descriptors. Additionally, as a swift action, a number of times per day equal to your Charisma modifier, you may sacrifice 1d4 hit points to double this resistance for 1 minute.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> You are always met by favorable winds and that makes it very hard to track you by scent. Anyone tracking you by scent suffers a -4 penalty to their Perception skill checks.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/seraph-feats#toc44\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
